  "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements WP-30B Phase 3A per `docs/implementation/wp-30b/PHASE3A-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md` (approved), on top of the merged Phase 2 ADRs (PR #30).\n\n- **New Desktop internal rendering layer**: `MapViewportBinding` (lifecycle owner: Runtime + Renderer + volatile IsClosed + CaptureFrame + RequestClose with B-subsequence and close-stage log), `MapViewportControl` (close check first in Render, detach-safe), `MapDrawOperation` (lease-based, using-scoped), `MapSceneRenderer` (stateless, M1 blank background), `ViewportFrameInput` (immutable frame value).\n- **C1**: binding close → workspace close → collection remove → workspace dispose. Sibling workspaces / session / AssetStore / Database untouched.\n- **C2**: single orchestration entry `CloseProjectLifetimeAsync()` — start-once idempotency (TCS + CAS; shared task for command path and window path), closes all live bindings before `ProjectSession.CloseAsync`, clears collections, fires `ProjectClosed` exactly once.\n- **Window Closing (R5)**: cancel → join the single orchestration → reclose; first waiter is the only final-close executor (double guard); no async void on lifecycle paths; failures observed, recorded, window still closes.\n- **P2 gap fix (approved)**: `ProjectSession.CloseAsync` now disposes each child workspace after closing it.\n- **Docs**: implementation plan (incl. adjustment log §10) + implementation report.\n\n## Tests\n\n17 new Desktop lifecycle tests + 2 Application session tests, all verifying real call order via program-order anchors and TCS gates (no sleeps). Local: Desktop 30/30, Presentation 111/111, Domain 266/266 pass; 16 pre-existing FieldPackage tests blocked locally by sandbox temp-write denial (unrelated to this diff; CI is authoritative).\n\n## Constraints honored\n\nNo new NuGet packages; no render thread/scheduler; no interface abstraction for Binding; no Skia drawing beyond blank background; no Application/Domain/Presentation source changes beyond the approved 4-line session fix; `docs/map-editor/implementation/` untouched.\n\n_ready for independent review; do not merge yet_",
